  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building new leaders and promoting citizenship from the base</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Excluded populations of young people with non-traditional gender identities or sexual orientations face violence and barriers to participation in their communities which often results in emigration. Asociacin Lambda (Lambda) works to improve the livelihoods of this marginalized group by providing technical assistance to community groups on management governance leadership and entrepreneurship skills. At the IAF we support community-led solutions to strengthen governance in Guatemala. Lambdas activities strengthen grassroots organizations through education and training and build peer-to-peer learning and action networks. This grant is part of the IAF&apos;s efforts to address the root causes of irregular migration in Central America.</narrative>
  </description>
